# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
.output
test-results
playwright-report
tests/bench/.bench-profile
# Raw per-run bench output (e.g. baseline_phase1.raw.json) is scratch and
# stays untracked. Exception: tests/bench/bakeoff_raw.json and
# tests/bench/pruning_study_raw.json are committed on purpose — they back
# tools/regen-bakeoff-report.ts (rebuild the Docs/planning report without
# re-running paid API/Ollama calls) and carry stepMatchDisagreements for
# the §10.1 human review pass. Keep excluding *.raw.json; do not add a
# pattern that would also catch these two.
tests/bench/*.raw.json
stats.html
stats-*.json
.wxt
web-ext.config.ts

